                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.5151/202: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gibson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-13T17:00:00-05:00">December 13, 1933—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>106. Your 121, December 11, 3 p.m., from Commercial Attaché for Commerce. This
                    Department would appreciate comment and recommendations from you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
